[Magic Number]
    Example: 1927
    1+9+2+7 = 19 → 1+9 = 10 → 1+0 = 1 → Magic

    Steps:
        1. While n > 9, sum its digits (replace n with sum).
        2. If final n == 1 → Magic number.

    Solution:
        #include <stdio.h>
        int sum_of_digits(int n) {
            int s = 0;
            while (n) {
                s += n % 10;
                n /= 10;
            }
            return s;
        }
        int main() {
            int n;
            scanf("%d", &n);
            while (n > 9)
                n = sum_of_digits(n);
            if (n == 1)
                printf("Magic number\n");
            else
                printf("Not Magic number\n");
            return 0;
        }

