[Deficient Number]
    Sum of proper divisors < number.
    Example: 10 → 1+2+5 = 8 < 10.

    Steps: Similar, check sum < n.

    Solution:
        #include <stdio.h>
        #include <math.h>
        int main() {
            int n, sum = 1;
            scanf("%d", &n);
            for (int i = 2; i <= sqrt(n); i++) {
                if (n % i == 0) {
                    sum += i;
                    if (i != n/i) sum += n/i;
                }
